  "name": "The Withering River and the Befouled Wellspring",
  "summary": "A sallow river across the south and, beyond it, a ring of leaning standing stones round a churning green pool.",
  "text": "A sallow river across the south and, beyond it, a ring of leaning standing stones round a churning green pool. The ceiling is a living wall of fungus, sixty feet up.",
  "rest": "risky",
  "rest_text": "The spores drift down on your bedrolls like a slow, soft snow, and the trees are listening."
